hadiths[10]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1828","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Allah Taala se bayan farmaya, us ne farmaya ke Ae mere bando! Main ne zulm ko apne upar haraam kiya aur tum par bhi haraam kiya, pas tum aapas mein aik doosray par zulm mat karo. Ae mere bando! Tum sab gumrah ho magar jis ko main raah batlaun. Pas tum mujh se rahnumayi talab karo main tumhari rahnumayi karun ga. Ae mere bando! Tum sab bhookay ho magar jis ko main khilaun. Pas tum mujh se khana maango main tumhein khilaun ga. Ae mere bando! Tum sab nangay ho magar jis ko main pehnaun. Pas tum mujh se kapra maango main tumhein pehnaun ga. Ae mere bando! Tum raat din ghalti kartay ho aur main sab gunah bakhshta hun. Pas tum mujh se bakhshish maango main tumhein bakhsh dun ga. Ae mere bando! Tum mera nuqsan nahi kar saktay aur na mujhe faida pahuncha saktay ho. Agar tumharay aglay aur pichlay aur aadmi aur jinnaat, sab aisay ho jayein jaisay tum mein bara parhezgaar shakhs ho to meri baadshahat mein kuch izafa na ho ga. Ae mere bando! Agar tumharay aglay aur pichlay aur aadmi aur jinnaat, sab aisay ho jayein jaisay tum mein bara badkaar shakhs ho to meri baadshahat mein kuch kami na ho gi. Ae mere bando! Agar tumharay aglay aur pichlay aur aadmi aur jinnaat, sab aik maidaan mein kharay hon, phir mujh se maangna shuru karein aur main har aik ko jo wo maangay de dun, tab bhi mere paas jo kuch hai wo kam na ho ga magar itna jaisay darya mein sui dubo kar nikaal lo, to darya ka pani jitna kam ho jata hai itna bhi mera khazana kam na ho ga, is liye ke darya kitna hi bara ho aakhir mehdood hai aur mera khazana beinteha hai. Pas ye sirf misaal hai. Ae mere bando! Ye to tumharay hi aamaal hain jin ko tumharay liye shumaar karta rehta hun, phir tumhein un aamaal ka poora badla dun ga. Pas jo shakhs behtar badla paye to chahiye ke Allah ka shukr ada karay, ke us ki kamayi bekaar na gayi, aur jo bura badla paye to apne tayein bura samjhay, ke us ne jaisa kiya waisa paya. Sa'id ne kaha ke Abu Idris Khaulani jab ye hadees bayan kartay to apne ghutnon ke bal gir par-tay. (Muslim: 8/17)"
"1829","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum zulm se bacho, kyunke zulm qayamat ke din andheray hain, zulm ko qayamat ke din bawajah taareeki aur andheray ke raah na milay gi, aur tum bakheeli se bacho, kyunke bakheeli ne tum se pehle logon ko tabah kiya. Bakheeli ki wajah se, maal ki tama, unhon ne khoon kiye aur haraam ko halaal kiya. (Muslim: 8/18)"
"1830","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Musalman Musalman ka bhai hai, pas na us par zulm karay na us ko tabahi mein daalay. Jo shakhs apne bhai ke kaam mein rahay ga, Allah Taala us ke kaam mein rahay ga aur jo shakhs kisi Musalman par se koi museebat door karay ga, Allah Taala us par se qayamat ki museebaton mein se aik museebat door karay ga aur jo shakhs Musalman ki parda poshi karay ga, Allah Taala qayamat ke din us ki parda poshi karay ga. (Muslim: 8/18). Baab: Zaalim ko mohlat dena."
"1831","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Azza wa Jal zaalim ko mohlat deta hai, us ki baag dheeli karta hai taake khoob shararat kar le aur azaab ka mustahiq ho jaye, phir jab pakarta hai to us ko nahi chhorta. Us ke baad Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ye aayat padhi ke: Tera Rab usi tarah pakarta hai jab bastiyon ko pakarta hai yani un bastiyon ko jo zulm karti hain beshak us ki pakar sakht dukh wali hai, Surah Hood: 102. (Muslim: 8/19)"
"1832","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Do larkay aapas mein lar paray. Un mein se aik Muhajireen mein se tha aur aik Ansaar mein se. Muhajir ne apne muhajiron ko pukara aur Ansaari ne Ansaar ko to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bahar niklay aur farmaya ke ye to jahiliyat ka sa pukarna hai, ke har aik apni qaum se madad leta hai aur doosri qaum se larta hai, Islam mein sab Musalman aik hain. Logon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Kuch bara muqaddama nahi. Do larkay lar paray to aik ne doosray ki sareen par maara. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke to kuch darr nahi, main to samjha tha ke koi bara fasaad hai. Chahiye ke aadmi apne bhai ki madad karay chahay wo zaalim ho ya mazloom. Agar wo zaalim hai to ye madad karay ke us ko zulm se rokay aur agar mazloom hai to us ki madad karay, aur us ko zaalim ke panja se chhuraye. (Muslim: 8/19). Baab: Jo logon ko azaab detay hain. (Kasaa se murad sareen par maarna hai.)"
"1833","[AI-translation] Urwa bin Zubair se Hisham bin Hakeem bin Hizam (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kartay hain, kehtay hain ke, Hisham, Shaam mein kuch logon ke qareeb se guzray wo dhoop mein kharay kiye gaye thay aur un ke saron par tail daala gaya tha. Unhon ne poocha ke ye kya hai? Logon ne kaha ke sarkaari mehsool denay ke liye un ko saza di jati hai. Unhon ne kaha ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke Allah un logon ko azaab karay ga jo duniya mein logon ko azaab kartay hain, yani nahaq. To us wo azaab daakhil nahi hai jo haddan ya tazeeran ho. (Muslim: 8/32). Baab: Zaalimon ke gharon mein na jao magar rotay hue. (Muslim mein annaas nahi hai.)"
"1834","[AI-translation] Ibn Shihab se riwayat hai aur wo qaum-e-Samood ke makanaat jis ka naam Hijr hai, ka zikr kar rahay thay aur kaha ke Salim bin Abdullah ne kaha ke Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne farmaya ke ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Hijr par se guzray to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke zaalimon ke gharon mein mat jao magar rotay hue aur bacho ke kahin tum par bhi wo azaab na aa jaye jo un par aaya tha. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apni sawaari ko daanta aur jaldi chalaya, yahan tak ke Hijr peechay reh gaya. (Muslim: 8/221). Baab: Azaab walon ke kunwan se pani lena. (Zajara se murad oontni haankna hai.)"
"1835","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke log Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Hijr, yani Samood ke mulk mein, utray to unhon ne wahan ke kunwan ka pani peenay ke liye liya aur us pani se aata gondha to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ko us pani ke baha denay aur aata oonton ko khilanay ka hukm diya aur farmaya ke peenay ka pani us kunwein se lein jis par Saleh (alaihissalam) ki oontni aati thi. (Muslim: 8/221). Baab: Qisaas aur qayamat ke din huqooq ada karna."
"1836","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum jantay ho ke muflis kaun hai? Logon ne arz kiya ke ham mein muflis wo hai jis ke paas rupiya aur asbaab na ho. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke muflis meri ummat mein qayamat ke din wo ho ga, jo namaz, roza aur zakaat ke saath aaye ga. Lekin us ne duniya mein aik ko gaali di ho gi, doosray ko badkaari ki tohmat lagayi ho gi, teesray ka maal kha liya ho ga, chauthay ka khoon kiya ho ga aur paanchwin ko maara ho ga. Phir un logon ko, yani jin ko us ne duniya mein sataya, us ki nekiyan mil jayein gi aur jo us ki nekiyan us ke gunah ada honay se pehle khatm ho jayein gi to un logon ki buraiyan us par daal di jayein gi, aakhir usay jahannam mein daal diya jaye ga. (Muslim: 8/18-19)"
"1837","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum qayamat ke din haqdaaron ke haq ada karo ge, yahan tak ke be seeng wali bakri ka badla seeng wali bakri se liya jaye ga, go ke janwaron ko azaab o sawab nahi lekin qisaas zaroor ho ga. (Muslim: 8/18-19)"
